#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to manage costs of running jobs on QPUs when using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan on IBM Quantum Platform."
msgstr "Cara mengelola biaya menjalankan job pada QPU saat menggunakan Pay-As-You-Go Plan di IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage cost on the Pay-As-You-Go Plan"
msgstr "Kelola biaya pada Pay-As-You-Go Plan"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage cost on the Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#manage-cost-on-the-pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Kelola biaya pada Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#manage-cost-on-the-pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide describes how to set a cost limit on your Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance.  You can also manage cost by [minimizing a workload's QPU usage](/guides/minimize-time), and setting a [maximum execution time](/guides/max-execution-time) on your workloads.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menjelaskan cara menetapkan batas biaya pada instance Pay-As-You-Go Plan Anda. Kamu juga bisa mengelola biaya dengan [meminimalkan penggunaan QPU workload](/guides/minimize-time), dan menetapkan [waktu eksekusi maksimum](/guides/max-execution-time) pada workload Anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _cost limit_ refers to the total cost of all workloads run with this instance since it was created, and it will always be greater than or equal to the total cost. After the instance reaches the specified number of total seconds, no further workloads can be run and no more cost is incurred.\n"
msgstr "_Batas biaya_ mengacu pada total biaya semua workload yang dijalankan dengan instance ini sejak dibuat, dan nilainya akan selalu lebih besar atau sama dengan total biaya aktual. Setelah instance mencapai jumlah total detik yang ditentukan, tidak ada workload lagi yang bisa dijalankan dan tidak ada biaya tambahan yang dikenakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      The cost limit is always specified in US dollars (USD), then converted to runtime seconds. However, for monthly billing purposes, you are charged in your local currency, specified on your IBM Cloud&reg; account. Because currency exchange rates can fluctuate, the cost for X runtime seconds might be different when initially calculated in USD than when you’re actually charged in your local currency. As a result, if your local currency is not USD, the total amount charged for the number of seconds specified in this field could vary from the dollar amount you specify.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Batas biaya selalu ditentukan dalam dolar AS (USD), lalu dikonversi ke detik runtime. Namun, untuk keperluan tagihan bulanan, Anda ditagih dalam mata uang lokal yang tercantum di akun IBM Cloud&reg; Anda. Karena nilai tukar mata uang bisa berfluktuasi, biaya untuk X detik runtime mungkin berbeda antara saat pertama kali dihitung dalam USD dan saat Anda benar-benar ditagih dalam mata uang lokal. Akibatnya, jika mata uang lokal Anda bukan USD, total jumlah yang ditagih untuk jumlah detik yang ditentukan di bidang ini bisa berbeda dari jumlah dolar yang Anda tentukan.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cost-limit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cost-limit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set or change a cost limit {#set-or-change-a-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Tetapkan atau ubah batas biaya {#set-or-change-a-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to set or change a limit on how much is spent:\n"
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk menetapkan atau mengubah batas pengeluaran:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **IBM Quantum Platform**: Open the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Find the instance you want to limit, click the Actions menu at the end of the row, and then click **Edit details**. Set the total cost limit or the usage limit, then click **Save changes**.\n"
"   <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   You can also set the cost or usage limit when creating a new instance under the Pay-As-You-Go Plan. When you select the Pay-As-You-Go tile, a field appears with the label \"Total cost limit (Optional)\". You can enter a total cost limit in this field.\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"* **IBM Quantum Platform**: Buka halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Temukan instance yang ingin Anda batasi, klik menu Actions di ujung baris, lalu klik **Edit details**. Tetapkan batas total biaya atau batas penggunaan, lalu klik **Save changes**.\n"
"   <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Kamu juga bisa menetapkan batas biaya atau penggunaan saat membuat instance baru di bawah Pay-As-You-Go Plan. Saat Anda memilih tile Pay-As-You-Go, sebuah kolom akan muncul dengan label \"Total cost limit (Optional)\". Kamu bisa memasukkan batas total biaya di kolom ini.\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**API**: [Set the instance limit in seconds](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances#tags__instances__operations__replace_instance_data).\n"
msgstr "**API**: [Tetapkan batas instance dalam detik](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances#tags__instances__operations__replace_instance_data).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Cloud CLI**: For instructions to use the CLI, refer to [Getting started with the IBM Cloud CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-getting-started).\n"
msgstr "**IBM Cloud CLI**: Untuk instruksi penggunaan CLI, lihat [Getting started with the IBM Cloud CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-getting-started).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View the cost limit {#view-the-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Lihat batas biaya {#view-the-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to view the current cost limit:\n"
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk melihat batas biaya saat ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Quantum Platform**: The Total cost limit is shown on the Pay-As-You-Go tab of the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) table.\n"
msgstr "**IBM Quantum Platform**: Batas total biaya ditampilkan pada tab Pay-As-You-Go di tabel [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**API**:\n"
msgstr "**API**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   See the [REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"
msgstr "   Lihat [dokumentasi REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a cost limit {#remove-a-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Hapus batas biaya {#remove-a-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can remove the cost limit in several ways:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menghapus batas biaya dengan beberapa cara:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Quantum Platform**: Open the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) table. Find the instance you want to update, click the overflow menu at the end of the row, and then click **Edit details**. Delete the total cost limit or the usage, then click **Save changes**.\n"
msgstr "**IBM Quantum Platform**: Buka tabel [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Temukan instance yang ingin Anda perbarui, klik menu overflow di ujung baris, lalu klik **Edit details**. Hapus batas total biaya atau penggunaan, lalu klik **Save changes**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**API**: [Set the instance limit to `null`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"
msgstr "**API**: [Tetapkan batas instance ke `null`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Only administrators and owners can edit the instance.  See the [Create access policies and access groups](/guides/access-groups) guide for information about assigning access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Hanya administrator dan pemilik yang bisa mengedit instance. Lihat panduan [Buat kebijakan akses dan grup akses](/guides/access-groups) untuk informasi tentang pemberian akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "What happens when the cost limit is reached {#what-happens-when-the-cost-limit-is-reached}"
msgstr "Apa yang terjadi saat batas biaya tercapai {#what-happens-when-the-cost-limit-is-reached}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a running job reports usage that causes the instance's cost limit to be exceeded, currently running jobs from that instance are stopped, their statuses are set to `Canceled` with a reason of `Ran too long`, and the account is billed for the usage.\n"
msgstr "Saat job yang sedang berjalan melaporkan penggunaan yang menyebabkan batas biaya instance terlampaui, job yang sedang berjalan dari instance tersebut dihentikan, statusnya diubah menjadi `Canceled` dengan alasan `Ran too long`, dan akun akan ditagih untuk penggunaan tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that job runtime is only reported periodically during execution. Therefore, the job might continue to run past the limit, or even to completion, and, as a result, the account can be billed for usage over the specified limit.\n"
msgstr "Perlu diketahui bahwa runtime job hanya dilaporkan secara berkala selama eksekusi. Oleh karena itu, job mungkin tetap berjalan melewati batas, atau bahkan sampai selesai, dan akibatnya, akun bisa ditagih untuk penggunaan melebihi batas yang ditentukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "No further jobs submitted by this instance will begin execution until the cost limit is increased.\n"
msgstr "Tidak ada job lagi yang akan dimulai eksekusinya menggunakan instance ini sampai batas biaya ditingkatkan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to see what you’re being charged {#how-to-see-what-youre-being-charged}"
msgstr "Cara melihat tagihan Anda {#how-to-see-what-youre-being-charged}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You will receive a monthly invoice that provides details about your resource charges. You can check how much has been spent at any time on the [IBM Cloud Billing and usage](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing) page.\n"
msgstr "Kamu akan menerima tagihan bulanan yang memberikan detail tentang biaya sumber daya Anda. Kamu bisa memeriksa berapa banyak yang telah dikeluarkan kapan saja di halaman [IBM Cloud Billing and usage](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page displays usage according to the filters you set. Additionally, you can determine cost per instance or per job at any time from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, as detailed below.\n"
msgstr "Halaman [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) menampilkan penggunaan sesuai dengan filter yang Anda tetapkan. Selain itu, Anda bisa menentukan biaya per instance atau per job kapan saja dari halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), seperti dijelaskan di bawah ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "View instance usage {#view-instance-usage}"
msgstr "Lihat penggunaan instance {#view-instance-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To determine how much has been billed to an instance, from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, click the instance to open its details page. The **Instance usage** field displays the total amount of this instance's QPU usage since it was created.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menentukan berapa banyak yang telah ditagihkan ke sebuah instance, dari halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), klik instance untuk membuka halaman detailnya. Kolom **Instance usage** menampilkan total jumlah penggunaan QPU instance ini sejak dibuat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view your billing cycle on the [Billing and usage page](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa melihat siklus tagihan Anda di [halaman Billing and usage](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "View workload usage {#view-workload-usage}"
msgstr "Lihat penggunaan workload {#view-workload-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To determine how much has been billed to each workload associated with an instance, from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, click the instance to open its details page. Next, click on the value under **Total workloads (all types)**.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menentukan berapa banyak yang telah ditagihkan ke setiap workload yang terkait dengan instance, dari halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), klik instance untuk membuka halaman detailnya. Selanjutnya, klik nilai di bawah **Total workloads (all types)**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The **Usage** column displays the amount of QPU consumed by the job.\n"
msgstr "Kolom **Usage** menampilkan jumlah QPU yang dikonsumsi oleh job.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up spending notifications {#set-up-spending-notifications}"
msgstr "Atur notifikasi pengeluaran {#set-up-spending-notifications}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can set up spending notifications to get notified when your account or a particular service reaches a specific spending threshold that you set. For information, see the [IBM Cloud Account types](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accounts) page. IBM Cloud spending notifications must be used with other methods of cost management for several reasons:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa mengatur notifikasi pengeluaran untuk mendapat pemberitahuan saat akun atau layanan tertentu mencapai ambang pengeluaran yang Anda tetapkan. Untuk informasi, lihat halaman [IBM Cloud Account types](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accounts). Notifikasi pengeluaran IBM Cloud harus digunakan bersama metode pengelolaan biaya lainnya karena beberapa alasan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The notifications trigger only *after* cost surpasses the specified limit.\n"
msgstr "Notifikasi hanya dipicu *setelah* biaya melampaui batas yang ditentukan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cost is submitted to the billing system hourly. Therefore, a long delay might occur between the job submission and the spending notification being sent.\n"
msgstr "Biaya dikirimkan ke sistem penagihan setiap jam. Oleh karena itu, bisa terjadi keterlambatan yang cukup lama antara pengiriman job dan pengiriman notifikasi pengeluaran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The billing system can take multiple days to get information to the invoicing system, which might cause further delay in notifications. For more information about how the IBM Cloud billing system works, see [Setting spending notifications](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/billing-usage?topic=billing-usage-spending).\n"
msgstr "Sistem penagihan bisa membutuhkan beberapa hari untuk menyampaikan informasi ke sistem invoicing, yang mungkin menyebabkan keterlambatan lebih lanjut dalam notifikasi. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara kerja sistem penagihan IBM Cloud, lihat [Setting spending notifications](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/billing-usage?topic=billing-usage-spending).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [plans](/guides/plans-overview) available to IBM Quantum users.\n"
"- Review suggestions to [minimize job QPU usage](/guides/minimize-time).\n"
"- Learn how to set a [maximum execution time](/guides/max-execution-time) on jobs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Tinjau [paket](/guides/plans-overview) yang tersedia untuk pengguna IBM Quantum.\n"
"- Tinjau saran untuk [meminimalkan penggunaan QPU job](/guides/minimize-time).\n"
"- Pelajari cara menetapkan [waktu eksekusi maksimum](/guides/max-execution-time) pada job.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
